 {
  "id": "7674291641930304782",
  "text": "Your prospects aren\u2019t ghosting you because they forgot about you.\n\nThey\u2019re ghosting you because your follow-up feels like work.\n\n\u201cJust checking in\u2026\u201d\n\u201cAny thoughts?\u201d\n\u201cWanted to circle back\u2026\u201d\n\nEvery one of those messages asks them to do something.\n\nElite salespeople understand the psychology: reduce pressure, create clarity, and never chase from a place of need.\n\nFollow up from a position of certainty and service. Make responding easy \u2014 and watch what happens.\n\nFollow @TheRyanKeip for more sales psychology, closing strategies, and real-world tactics you can actually use.\n\n#Sal#SalesPsychologyl#SalesTrainingo#ClosingDealsl#SalesTipsanKeipCoaching",
